    brick), the K-quant dual-scale + bsums-min fold is RE-EMITTED WHOLE by the typed
    emitter keyed off this brick's identity (the SAME construction discipline as the
    ternary core), so the region carries ONLY this core brick + the per-strip
    accumulator pass-through yield.

